{"time": 1771166631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96752345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882007244]“诶呦喂，你一边去。”捂住她嘴，“不会讲话就去小孩那桌喝饮料”[CQ:at,qq=3396647920]"}
{"time": 1771166666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966223498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=690623500]“旅游？你们旅游不去其他地方，来我们这种小镇？”他将信将疑地看了你们一眼。“这里是永雾大学，当地人都简称雾大。”"}
{"time": 1771166676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766799010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96752345]（喝醉了）"}
{"time": 1771166698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176203140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96752345][CQ:at,qq=3335863425] 默不作声移开她的手。"}
{"time": 1771166722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656370590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“这里就是雾大吗？很巧啊，我们就是要来这的，先生，您可以给我们讲讲吗？我们真的很感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1771166739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220233646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1783092490]他挠了挠头。“我不知道。我学生证没带，门卫是不让进的，所以才抄的小路……”"}
{"time": 1771166763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642974603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "2963988243"}, "sender": {"id": "2963988243", "name": "Ava"}, "message": "笑了笑“啊，因为是被朋友推荐过来的。原来是学生吗，可以带我们逛逛学校吗？”"}
{"time": 1771166766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898152836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "潘旭英看着队友一堆莫名其妙的操作脑门旁边想扣问号"}
{"time": 1771166794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228016802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "“我最近在研究课题，在灯塔天文台那块。我的老师让我回来查点资料。结果学生证不知道落在哪了……”"}
{"time": 1771166798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494738998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "选择沉默"}
{"time": 1771166882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193914827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "他抓了抓脸颊。“理论上……雾大是不让外人参观的，但是最近放假了，学校里也没什么人……你们跟着我，从这条小道抄进去就是图书馆。”"}
{"time": 1771166895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994512812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1486497852"}, "sender": {"id": "1486497852", "name": "海阔凭鱼跃"}, "message": "“好哦，谢谢您”"}
{"time": 1771166898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613704199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "“......那麻烦您带路了”"}
{"time": 1771166900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054386629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3496915564"}, "sender": {"id": "3496915564", "name": "Achora"}, "message": "“感谢”"}
{"time": 1771166906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660313494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1162084637"}, "sender": {"id": "1162084637", "name": "十二月星回"}, "message": "“谢谢你好心人”"}
{"time": 1771166912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518603732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“话说，你晓得最近外地人搁本地失踪的事不”"}
{"time": 1771166918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214425085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "2963988243"}, "sender": {"id": "2963988243", "name": "Ava"}, "message": "“非常感谢，麻烦了”"}
{"time": 1771166933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360372481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "（潘旭英：猛攻）"}
{"time": 1771166978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255689830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "（喂）"}
{"time": 1771166980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2649557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1518603732]“失踪？我不太清楚。我快毕业了，课题一直做不完，本地唯一的天文台又在灯塔，我真是字面意义的被“束之高阁”了……”"}
{"time": 1771166999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875828930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“听着好惨。”"}
{"time": 1771167003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561815769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "你们一边聊着，一边从小路翻进了学校。"}
{"time": 1771167020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555489363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“你是学啥的？天文学？”"}
{"time": 1771167043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739550811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "永雾大学内的建筑华丽而繁复，充满了浓郁的西式美学。正是假期，校园内一个人也没有，反而笼罩着一层厚重的白雾。雾气如同白色的纱幔，阻挡着你们的视线。"}
{"time": 1771167044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828435417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“听着牛逼哄哄的诶！”"}
{"time": 1771167052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990852068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "“等这里查完了，就去灯塔看看吧。”"}
{"time": 1771167080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075481031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "“......这里还真是雾大”"}
