{"time": 1771167182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501671797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3396647920"}, "sender": {"id": "3396647920", "name": "扶寒抹茶全肯定"}, "message": "“看来是传统强项了......介意和我们聊聊你的课题吗？”"}
{"time": 1771167189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704017758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "3335863425"}, "sender": {"id": "3335863425", "name": "骨蝶"}, "message": "“诶呦喂，那咱算是来对地方了。”"}
