{"time": 1771167235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082901486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "2963988243"}, "sender": {"id": "2963988243", "name": "Ava"}, "message": "“三百年前啊，的确是很厉害的专业。你是镇上的人吗？”"}
{"time": 1771167244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56116972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "111918256", "user_id": "1257856112"}, "sender": {"id": "1257856112", "name": "09"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1501671797]他摇了摇头。“那不太行，万一泄题了我就要延毕了。”"}
